      "ask_about_rider_fit": "Ask about rider fit",
      "rider_on_a_panquire_t_01_electric": "Rider on a Panquire T-01 electric dirt bike",
      "a_lightweight_electric_dirt_bike_for_tight": "A lightweight electric dirt bike for tight trails",
      "a_55_kg_bike_is_easier_to": "A 55 kg bike is easier to push around the garage or turn around when a trail ends. The T-01 pairs its aluminum alloy frame with a 19-inch front wheel for rolling over roots and a 17-inch rear wheel. Hydraulic disc brakes give you control as you slow for turns. For adults and teens considering the T-01, start with Panquire’s 160 to 190 cm recommended rider height, then check reach, experience, and local age rules.",
      "panquire_t_01_rider_on_a_hillside": "Panquire T-01 rider on a hillside",
      "change_power_from_the_handlebar": "Change power from the handlebar",
      "the_60v_system_gives_you_three_power": "The 60V system gives you three power settings and a stated top speed of 80 km/h. Use low for slow sections and select more power where the terrain and your experience call for it. With no clutch to work, you can focus on your line through a tight corner. When comparing bikes at this price, check how the controls and wheel sizes fit the riding you actually do.",
      "panquire_t_01_being_ridden_off_road": "Panquire T-01 being ridden off road",
      "what_affects_electric_dirt_bike_range": "What affects electric dirt bike range?",
      "the_60v_31_2ah_battery_comes_out": "The 60V 31.2Ah battery comes out so you can take it to an outlet and charge it with the supplied 6A charger. For an out-and-back ride, use the stated Eco range as a starting point. Sustained climbs, loose ground and higher speeds can shorten it. Leave enough charge for the return leg.",
      "panquire_t_02_price_and_performance": "Panquire T-02 / Price and performance",
      "a_72v_electric_dirt_bike_for_demanding": "A 72V electric dirt bike for demanding trails",
      "the_t_02_pairs_a_13_kw": "The T-02 pairs a 13 kW peak motor with a removable 2,952 Wh battery and an adjustable rear shock. The Qronge X7 Spark lists 12 kW peak and a larger 3,600 Wh battery. If you’re choosing between them, weigh that extra battery capacity against the T-02’s vehicle price and equipment. Peak power alone tells you little about how either bike accelerates or handles.",
      "13_kw_peak_performance": "13 kW peak performance",
      "stated_top_speed_of_100_km_h": "Stated top speed of 100 km/h (about 62 mph), depending on riding conditions.",
      "removable_72v_41ah_battery": "Removable 72V 41Ah battery",
      "up_to_90_km_in_eco_mode": "Up to 90 km in Eco mode, as rated by Panquire. Actual range varies.",
      "off_road_control": "Off-road control",
      "three_power_levels_dual_piston_hydraulic_disc": "Three power levels, dual-piston hydraulic disc brakes and an adjustable rear shock.",
      "compare_electric_dirt_bike_models": "Compare electric dirt bike models",
      "explore_the_60v_t_01": "Explore the 60V T-01",
      "panquire_t_02_electric_dirt_bike_being": "Panquire T-02 electric dirt bike being ridden off road",
      "choose_your_power_at_the_handlebar": "Choose your power at the handlebar",
      "on_a_tight_trail_you_can_select": "On a tight trail, you can select low power from the handlebar and switch to medium or high as the terrain opens up. There’s no clutch to work when you slow for a turn. The 72V system feeds a mid-mounted motor rated for 6 kW continuous and 13 kW peak. Those figures describe the motor’s output. Traction, rider weight and the terrain all affect how the bike accelerates.",
      "panquire_t_02_electric_dirt_bike_on": "Panquire T-02 electric dirt bike on a trail",
      "plan_your_range_around_the_route": "Plan your range around the route",
      "at_72v_and_41ah_the_removable_battery": "At 72V and 41Ah, the removable battery has 2.952 kWh of nominal energy. Use the stated Eco range as a starting point for a trail loop, with charge in reserve for the ride back. Long climbs, soft ground, cold weather and higher speeds can all shorten the distance. Back home, you can remove the pack and charge it with the supplied 18A charger.",
      "panquire_t_02_rider_turning_on_loose": "Panquire T-02 rider turning on loose ground",
      "set_the_chassis_up_for_the_way": "Set the chassis up for the way you ride",
      "the_60_kg_t_02_uses_an": "The 60 kg T-02 uses an aluminum alloy frame, a 19-inch front wheel and a 17-inch rear wheel. The larger front wheel helps roll over roots and ruts. You can adjust rear shock compression, rebound and preload, and set the brake lever reach to suit your hands.",
      "when_comparing_a_high_performance_electric_dirt": "When comparing a high-performance electric dirt bike, check the parts you’ll use and maintain every ride: suspension, brakes, tires and chain. Follow the owner’s manual for routine care and",
      "ask_panquire_about_compatible_replacement_parts": "ask Panquire about compatible replacement parts",
      "options": "options",
      "select_optional_accessory_products_to_show": "Select optional accessory products to show “",
      "faq_t01_1_question": "Is the T-01 suitable for adults or teens?",
      "faq_t01_1_answer_html": "Both. The T-01 fits adult and teen riders who can comfortably handle the bike. The recommended rider height is 160 to 190 cm (about 5 ft 3 in to 6 ft 3 in). Check local age requirements for where you plan to ride.",
      "faq_t01_2_question": "How fast can the T-01 go?",
      "faq_t01_2_answer_html": "The T-01 has a stated top speed of 80 km/h (about 50 mph). Actual speed depends on riding conditions.",
      "faq_t01_3_question": "What is the range on a single charge?",
      "faq_t01_3_answer_html": "The stated range is 80 km (about 50 miles) in Eco mode. Your actual range depends on speed, rider weight, terrain, temperature, and riding style.",
      "faq_t01_4_question": "Why choose the T-01?",
      "faq_t01_4_answer_html": "The T-01 is a 55 kg electric dirt bike with 9.5 kW of peak power. You can select low, medium, or high power from the handlebar without using a clutch. The battery comes out so you can charge it away from the bike.",
      "faq_t01_5_question": "Is it street legal?",
      "faq_t01_5_answer_html": "The T-01 is designed for off-road riding. Before taking it onto public roads, check whether your local rules allow this model and what they require for registration, licensing, and insurance.",
      "faq_t01_6_question": "What warranty do I get?",
      "faq_t01_6_answer_html": "Panquire’s one-year limited warranty covers the motor, battery, and controller from the date of delivery. Your statutory consumer rights also apply.",
      "faq_t01_7_question": "How fast will it ship?",
      "faq_t01_7_answer_html": "We aim to dispatch in-stock orders within three business days after payment confirmation and any required checks. If you’re preordering, we’ll show the applicable schedule before you pay. Delivery takes up to 30 calendar days from order confirmation in the United States, Canada, Mexico and Europe, and up to 35 calendar days elsewhere.",
      "faq_t01_8_question": "What if I need help or service?",
      "faq_t01_8_answer_html": "Email <a href=\"mailto:support@panquire.com\">support@panquire.com</a> or use our <a href=\"{{ contact_url }}\">Contact Us</a> page. If you’ve already ordered, include your order number and a short description of the issue. For a warranty claim, include your proof of purchase so we can review your claim and explain the next steps.",
      "faq_t02_1_question": "What is an electric dirt bike, and where can you ride one?",
      "faq_t02_1_answer_html": "An electric dirt bike is a battery-powered motorcycle designed for off-road use. Ride the T-02 at parks and on designated motorized trails that permit electric motorcycles, or on private land with permission. Check local rules before using public roads, bike lanes or shared paths.",
      "faq_t02_2_question": "Why choose the Panquire T-02 over alternatives?",
      "faq_t02_2_answer_html": "The T-02 combines 13 kW of peak motor power, a removable 72V battery and an adjustable rear shock at its listed vehicle price. If you’re considering the Sur-Ron Ultra Bee, 79BIKE Falcon Pro or Qronge X7 Spark, compare the exact configurations, battery capacities and purchase prices in <a href=\"{{ compare_url ",
      "faq_t02_3_question": "Is the T-02 suitable for adults?",
      "faq_t02_3_answer_html": "While the T-02 is suitable for teenagers with prior motorcycle riding experience, it is primarily designed for adult-sized riders due to its top speed of 100 km/h (62 mph) and peak power of 13,000 W. Our testing has confirmed that the T-02 can support riders weighing up to 150 kg (331 lb) and is ideal for riders taller than 160 cm (5'3\"). Therefore, we can confidently say that experienced riders aged 16 and above who meet these requirements can ride the T-02 comfortably and confidently, with appropriate safety precautions.",
      "faq_t02_4_question": "What is the range on a single charge?",
      "faq_t02_4_answer_html": "Panquire rates the T-02 for up to 90 km (56 miles) in Eco mode. Actual range depends on speed, terrain, rider weight, temperature and how you ride.",
      "faq_t02_5_question": "What warranty do I get?",
      "faq_t02_5_answer_html": "Panquire’s <a href=\"{{ terms_url }}\">one-year limited warranty</a> covers the motor, battery and controller from the date of delivery. Your statutory consumer rights also apply.",
      "faq_t02_6_question": "How fast will it ship?",
      "faq_t02_6_answer_html": "We aim to dispatch in-stock orders within three business days after payment confirmation and any required checks. If you preorder, you’ll see the applicable schedule before you pay. Delivery takes up to 30 calendar days from order confirmation in the United States, Canada, Mexico and Europe, and up to 35 calendar days elsewhere. See the <a href=\"{{ shipping_url ",
      "faq_t02_7_question": "What if I need help or service?",
      "faq_t02_7_answer_html": "Email <a href=\"mailto:support@panquire.com\">support@panquire.com</a> or <a href=\"{{ contact_url "
    }
